  "details": "Probably has been discussed. Probably has been declined before. \n\nBUT\n\nif VRChat changed from using whatever it does on each platform to Vulkan, which is supported by Windows, Linux, Android, iOS and Quest, then vrchat avatars and worlds would be FAR EASIER to be ported to all platforms than it is currently.\n\nNot only that, PERFORMANCE could improve, as Vulkan is A LOT faster than options like directx 11, which is used on Windows.",
